
%p.lead Electric vehicle charging network comparison.

%p.lead= link_to "See all the charging networks &rarr;".html_safe, networks_path(countryCode: 'uk')

%h2 Compare the networks

.row.row-cols-1.row-cols-md-2.g-3
  .col
    .card
      .card-body
        %h5.card-title Pay-as-you-go

        %p.card-text
          Compare the pay-as-you-go options, where no registration is required,
          across the United Kingdom's public charging networks.

        = link_to "Compare pay-as-you-go costs", '#', class: "btn btn-primary disabled"
  .col
    .card
      .card-body
        %h5.card-title Memberships

        %p.card-text
          Compare the membership options across the United Kingdom's
          public charging networks.

        = link_to "Compare membership costs", '#', class: "btn btn-primary disabled"
